LLaDA-Image T8

Standalone ComfyUI adaptation by T8mars, 2026.

The ComfyUI integration, configuration and loader derive from ComfyUI
(https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI), licensed under GPL-3.0.
Validated native implementation source: T8mars/ComfyUI commit
dc323cad8de7eb4410c4736be58a88e89d3300b8, production-equivalent to
1596f90f9c732e4f41fdd2824c104cb3751e1e98.
Standalone changes relocate models into this package, add an AIO loader,
namespace node IDs and provide frontend workflows. No Core registry is patched.

runtime/model.py, runtime/conditioning.py and runtime/text_encoder.py contain
adaptations of Apache-2.0 licensed LLaDA-Image / Hugging Face model code.
Their original copyright and license notices are retained in those files.
Original project: https://github.com/inclusionAI/LLaDA-Image
Reference code revision: b4dfa9a3e50d90d6718975ca1fa1b0edbc90d512.
Pinned model sources are recorded in manifests/*.source.json.

Model weights are NOT distributed in this code package. Original weights are
from inclusionAI. T8-converted AIO artifacts are hosted separately at
https://huggingface.co/t8star/LLaDa-Image-Comfy under the source model license.
